# Line-ending policy.
#
# The repo is uniformly LF (see `git ls-files --eol`). The entries below pin
# files that are consumed verbatim via `include_str!` to LF on checkout: if
# git converts them to CRLF (the default on Windows runners), byte-exact
# comparisons like `parser::tests::parse_chunk` fail, and stub offsets shift.

crates/fennel-parser/testdata/** text eol=lf
stubs/** text eol=lf
